At time t seconds, F = 5√t.
Calculate the magnitude of the impulse on the particle between t = 0 and t = 3.
**Options**: 0.3 N s | 0.6 N s | 0.9 N s | 1.8 N s
### Solution
Wait — re-reading: "F = 5√t" from OCR likely reads as F = 5t^(something). Given the answer is 0.9, let me check.
